# Delete icon

Use a **red trash can** for every delete control in the admin app (consistent with table row menus).

## Inline delete buttons

```html
<p-button
  icon="pi pi-trash"
  [text]="true"
  severity="danger"
  size="small"
  aria-label="Delete …"
  (click)="…"
/>
```

- Icon: `pi pi-trash` (not `pi-times`, `pi-ban`, etc.)
- Style: `severity="danger"` and `[text]="true"` unless a filled button is required
- Always set a specific `aria-label` (e.g. `Delete line`, `Remove task`)

## Table row menus

Row delete actions use the same icon via `RowActionItem`:

```typescript
{ id: 'delete', label: 'Delete', icon: 'pi pi-trash', severity: 'danger', command: () => this.confirmDelete(row) }
```

See `table-row-actions.mdc` and `confirm-delete.mdc` for menu placement and confirmation before destructive API calls.

## Do not

- Use `pi-times` for delete (reserved for close/clear, e.g. search clear)
- Skip confirmation when deleting persisted records (see `confirm-delete.mdc`)
